{{Quote|We can't go back to Jakku! We need to get outta this system!|[[Finn]]|<ref name="TFA" />}}
The '''Jakku system''' was a [[star system]] located in a barely populated [[Jakku's sector|sector]]<ref name="Victory's Price" /> within the [[Western Reaches]] of [[the galaxy]]'s [[Inner Rim Territories|Inner Rim]]<ref name="Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of Star Wars: The Force Awakens?">{{SW|url=news/where-in-the-galaxy-are-the-worlds-of-star-wars-the-force-awakens|text=Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of ''Star Wars: The Force Awakens''?|int=Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of Star Wars: The Force Awakens?}}</ref> that contained the [[planet]] [[Jakku]]<ref name="Survival Guide" /> and its two [[moon]]s.<ref name="Complete Locations" />

==History==
One [[Standard year|year]] after the [[Battle of Endor]], the [[Galactic Empire]] made a last stand in the [[Star system|system]], with a giant [[Battle of Jakku|battle]] that raged above [[Jakku]].<ref name="Lost">''[[Lost Stars]]''</ref> Thirty years later, the system was [[Attack on Tuanul|visited]] by the [[First Order]]'s [[Resurgent-class Star Destroyer|''Resurgent''-class Star Destroyer]] ''[[Finalizer]]'', acting on a lead that a [[Map to Skywalker|map]] to [[Luke Skywalker]] existed on the [[planet]]. The ''[[Millennium Falcon]]'', [[pilot]]ed by [[Rey Skywalker|Rey]], [[Finn]], and [[BB-8]], [[Escape from Jakku|escaped]] from the planet to be captured by the ''[[Eravana]]'' within the system. A [[Skirmish aboard the Eravana|conflict]] occurred onboard between [[Han Solo]], [[Chewbacca]] and the fugitives with members of the [[Guavian Death Gang]] and [[Kanjiklub]], and three [[rathtar]]s. The group finally departed the system as Solo sent the ''Falcon'' into [[hyperspace]] directly from within the ''Eravana''{{'s}} [[Hangar|docking bay]].<ref name="TFA" />

==Behind the scenes==
{{Quote|Told you we should have double-checked the Western Reaches.|Han Solo, to Chewbacca|<ref name="TFA" />}}
The comic [[The High Republic — The Blade 1|''The High Republic — The Blade'' 1]] incorrectly places Jakku in the [[Tashtor sector]] near [[Takodana]],<ref name="Blade">[[The High Republic — The Blade 1|''The High Republic — The Blade'' 1]]</ref> though all other sources contradict this.<ref name="Map">{{StarWarsGalaxyMap}}</ref> Jakku has consistently been stated to fall in the Western Reaches,<ref name="TFA" /> but the ''[[Star Wars: The Galactic Explorer's Guide]]''{{'s}} map of the Western Reaches excluded Jakku.<ref name="Explorer">''[[Star Wars: The Galactic Explorer's Guide]]''</ref> Author [[Jason Fry]] has stated that the ''Explorer's Guide'' map should not be taken as overriding other sources, and that the Western Reaches do include Jakku.<ref name="Fry">{{EmailCite|email=File:AtlasEmail-2025-08-31.png|creator=[[Jason Fry]]|date=2025-08-31}}</ref>

